        },
        {
          "text": " Kosawa kaŋol kopotu ikesisiak mama ejai Yesu, kotemasi atiar, “Aso iŋai bo erai lokapolon kotoma ajakanut naka akuj?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.1",
